cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Enterprise Shared Memory: a governed shared-memory control plane for coding agents"
authors:
  - family-names: "Enterprise Shared Memory contributors"
version: 0.3.0rc1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Scuttie/enterprise-shared-memory-poc"
keywords: [coding-agents, memory, governance, retrieval, mcp, swe-bench]
abstract: >
  A governed shared-memory control plane for coding agents (PostgreSQL-authoritative experience cards, a
  replaceable vector index, a utility-aware USE/ABSTAIN router, and auditable governance). The project makes no
  general coding-performance-lift claim; see reports/ for the controlled evaluations (R14-R21).
